  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。多款適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>巨型生成（Giant Spawn）是一款極簡化、可設定的模組，讓巨人能夠自然生成。每當殭屍生成時，有機會變為巨人，預設機率為 1/20，且僅限於地表。此模組也為巨人加入了基於殭屍 AI 的自訂人工智慧。<br><br></p>\n<p>您可能也會對&nbsp;<span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/skeleton-horse-spawn\"><strong>骷髏馬生成</strong></a>&nbsp;</span>或&nbsp;<span><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/zombie-horse-spawn\">殭屍馬生成</a></strong></span>感興趣。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/spawn-bundle.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's Spawn Bundle\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>chanceSurfaceZombieIsGiant</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 0.05，最小值 0，最大值 1.0<br>地表生成的殭屍變為巨人的機率。<br><br><span><strong>shouldBurnGiantsInDaylight</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true<br>啟用後，巨人受到日光照射時會燃燒。<br><br><span><strong>onlySpawnGiantOnSurface</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true<br>啟用後，巨人只會在地表生成。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>giantMovementSpeedModifier</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 1.0，最小值 0，最大值 20.0<br>相對於基礎殭屍移動速度的巨人移動速度修正值。<br><br><span><strong>giantAttackDamageModifier</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 2.0，最小值 0，最大值 20.0<br>相對於基礎殭屍攻擊傷害的巨人攻擊傷害修正值。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>巨人以其自訂 AI 移動：</strong><br></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/giant-spawn/a.webp\" alt=\"巨人移動\" width=\"1000\" height=\"540\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載來源保持於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台內。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概覽與詳細資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請至 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
